}\pard\plain \s82\li720\widctlpar\ql\adjustright \fs20\cgrid Future invalid OpenGL and OpenGL ES versions, for example OpenGL 4.8 if 5.0 comes out before the 4.x series gets that far, also fail with this error and not {\b GLFW_INVALID_VALUE}, because GLFW cannot know what future versions will exist. \par
